  "id": "air-fryer-oven-beef-jerky",
  "name": "Air Fryer Oven Beef Jerky",
  "subtitle": "Seasoned beef strips slowly dried in an air fryer oven.",
  "description": "A simple homemade beef jerky prepared with cured, seasoned London broil and dried at low heat.",
